«
@@ ============================================================
@@ UTMtoLL — Universal Transverse Mercator coordinates to latitude and
@@ longitude on the WGS-84 ellipsoid. Krüger series in the form of
@@ C. F. F. Karney, Journal of Geodesy 85 (2011), to order 4.
@@
@@ Input : zone hemisphere E N — zone 1 to 60, "N" or "S", easting and
@@         northing. Plain numbers are metres; lengths with a unit are
@@         accepted.
@@ Output: φ λ — latitude and longitude (East positive).
@@ Angle mode and angle units setting are restored before returning.
@@ ============================================================

  2 →LIST
  « IF DUP TypeName "unit" == THEN 1_m CONVERT UVAL END →Num »
  MAP LIST→ DROP
  → zon hem est nth
  «
    IF zon 1 < zon 60 > OR THEN "UTM zone must be from 1 to 60" DOERR END
    IF hem "N" == hem "S" == OR NOT THEN
      "UTM hemisphere must be N or S" DOERR
    END
    'AngleMode' RCL 'SetAngleUnits' RCL
    RAD NoAngleUnits
    Ⓒe12♁GPS →Num
    nth hem "S" == 10000000 0 IFTE - 6.36490216616508551E+06 /
    est 500000 - 6.36490216616508551E+06 /
    → amode aunits ee2 xi eta
    «
      'xi+-8.37732164057948645E-4*SIN(2*xi)*COSH(2*eta)+-5.90587015286819935E-8*SIN(4*xi)*COSH(4*eta)+-1.67348265152076686E-10*SIN(6*xi)*COSH(6*eta)+-2.16482368859791067E-13*SIN(8*xi)*COSH(8*eta)' EVAL 'eta+-8.37732164057948645E-4*COS(2*xi)*SINH(2*eta)+-5.90587015286819935E-8*COS(4*xi)*SINH(4*eta)+-1.67348265152076686E-10*COS(6*xi)*SINH(6*eta)+-2.16482368859791067E-13*COS(8*xi)*SINH(8*eta)' EVAL
      → xpr epr
      «
        'SIN(xpr)/√(SINH(epr)²+COS(xpr)²)' EVAL ee2 √
        → tc0 ecc
        «
          tc0
          1 5 START
            → tau
            «
              'SINH(ecc*ATANH(ecc*tau/√(1+tau²)))' EVAL
              → sgm
              «
                'tau*√(1+sgm²)-sgm*√(1+tau²)' EVAL
                → tci
                «
                  'tau+(tc0-tci)/√(1+tci²)*(1+(1-ee2)*tau²)/((1-ee2)*√(1+tau²))' EVAL
                »
              »
            »
          NEXT
          ATAN 180 * Ⓒπ →Num / 1_° *
          'ATAN(SINH(epr)/COS(xpr))' EVAL 180 * Ⓒπ →Num / 6 zon * 183 - + 1_° *
        »
      »
      amode EVAL IF aunits THEN SetAngleUnits ELSE NoAngleUnits END
    »
  »
»
